Package: claw-os-base
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Claw OS <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/xiaoyu-work/claw-os
Depends: claw-os-agent (= __VERSION__), systemd,
 init-system-helpers (>= 1.52)
Description: Claw OS distribution integration layer
 Extends `claw-os-agent` with the recovery helper, managed OverlayFS
 agent home, and boot/service policies used by Claw OS WSL, Docker,
 VM, ISO, Azure, and installed-system images.
 .
 This package is not required on Debian or Ubuntu hosts that only want
 the reusable system agent. It deliberately owns no agent runtime,
 headless app, browser, branding, launcher, or desktop files.
